বিকল্প: $\tan 90^\circ = \frac{x \sin \alpha}{3 + x \cos \alpha} \Rightarrow 3 + x \cos \alpha = 0 \Rightarrow x \cos \alpha = -3$;
এখন, লব্ধি = $4 \Rightarrow \sqrt{3^2 + x^2 + 2 \cdot 3 \cdot x \cos \alpha} = 4 \Rightarrow 9 + x^2 + 6(-3) = 16 \therefore x = 5 \text{ kmh}^{-1}$
